{"id": 12220, "title": "Favorite country", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "favorite-country", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/12220_favorite-country.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我和家人们现在越来越喜欢出国旅游。我的哥哥喜欢去日本，因为他很喜欢日本文化。我的妈妈喜欢欧洲，因为欧洲有很多漂亮的城市。我的爸爸喜欢美国，因为那些国家公园的自然环境很美。我最喜欢泰国，很多泰国人都能说一点儿英语，去哪儿都很方便，还有漂亮的海和好吃的食物。泰国一直是夏天，这也是我最喜欢的季节。如果能一直在泰国生活就好了！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我和家人們現在越來越喜歡出國旅遊。我的哥哥喜歡去日本，因為他很喜歡日本文化。我的媽媽喜歡歐洲，因為歐洲有很多漂亮的城市。我的爸爸喜歡美國，因為那些國家公園的自然環境很美。我最喜歡泰國，很多泰國人都能說一點兒英語，去哪兒都很方便，還有漂亮的海和好吃的食物。泰國一直是夏天，這也是我最喜歡的季節。如果能一直在泰國生活就好了！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ hé jiā rén men xiàn zài yuè lái yuè xǐ huan chū guó lǚ yóu。 wǒ de gē ge xǐ huan qù Rì běn， yīn wèi tā hěn xǐ huan Rì běn wén huà。 wǒ de mā ma xǐ huan Ōu zhōu， yīn wèi Ōu zhōu yǒu hěn duō piào liang de chéng shì。 wǒ de bà ba xǐ huan Měi guó， yīn wèi nà xiē guó jiā gōng yuán de zì rán huán jìng hěn měi。 wǒ zuì xǐ huan Tài guó， hěn duō Tài guó rén dōu néng shuō yī diǎn r Yīng yǔ， qù nǎ r dōu hěn fāng biàn， hái yǒu piào liang de hǎi hé hǎo chī de shí wù。 Tài guó yī zhí shì xià tiān， zhè yě shì wǒ zuì xǐ huan de jì jié。 rú guǒ néng yī zhí zài Tài guó shēng huó jiù hǎo le！"], "english_paragraphs": ["My family and I now like to travel abroad more and more. My brother likes to go to Japan because he likes Japanese culture. My mother likes Europe because there are many beautiful cities in Europe. My dad likes the United States because of the beautiful natural environment in those national parks. I like Thailand the most. Many Thai people can speak a little English. It is easy to go everywhere. There is also a beautiful sea and delicious food. It’s always summer in Thailand and it’s my favorite season. It would be great if I could always live in Thailand!"], "english_full": "My family and I now like to travel abroad more and more. My brother likes to go to Japan because he likes Japanese culture. My mother likes Europe because there are many beautiful cities in Europe. My dad likes the United States because of the beautiful natural environment in those national parks. I like Thailand the most. Many Thai people can speak a little English. It is easy to go everywhere. There is also a beautiful sea and delicious food. It’s always summer in Thailand and it’s my favorite season. It would be great if I could always live in Thailand!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā rén\" data-defn=\"family member\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家人</span><span class=\"tr\">家人</span><rt>jiā rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"men\" data-defn=\"plural marker for pronouns, and nouns referring to individuals\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">们</span><span class=\"tr\">們</span><rt>men</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiàn zài\" data-defn=\"now; at present; currently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yuè lái yuè\" data-defn=\"more and more\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">越来越</span><span class=\"tr\">越來越</span><rt>yuè lái yuè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chū guó\" data-defn=\"to go abroad; to leave the country\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">出国</span><span class=\"tr\">出國</span><rt>chū guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǚ yóu\" data-defn=\"to travel\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">旅游</span><span class=\"tr\">旅遊</span><rt>lǚ yóu</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\"